//! The `transition-behavior` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property
//! specifies whether transitions will be started for properties whose animation behavior is
//! [discrete](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Animations/Animatable_properties#discrete).
//!
//! Initial: normal. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - allow-discrete: Transitions will be started on the element for discrete animated properties.
//! - normal: Transitions will _not_ be started on the element for discrete animated properties.
//!
//! Grammar: <transition-behavior-value>#
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-transitions-2/#propdef-transition-behavior
//!
//! Author guide:
